<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy - PDF Viewer Pro</title>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root { --primary: #0097A7; --secondary: #00796B; --accent: #FFEB3B; --bg: #f0f4f8; --card: #ffffff; --text: #2c3e50; }
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text); background-color: var(--bg); margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
        .container { max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; background: var(--card); padding: 45px; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border-top: 8px solid var(--primary); }
        .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .header i { font-size: 50px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 15px; }
        h1 { color: var(--primary); margin: 0; font-size: 2.2em; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }
        h2 { color: var(--secondary); margin-top: 35px; border-left: 4px solid var(--primary); padding-left: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
        h2 i { margin-right: 12px; font-size: 0.9em; }
        p { margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 1.05em; text-align: justify; }
        .highlight-box { background: #e0f7fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; border-right: 4px solid var(--primary); margin: 20px 0; }
        ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
        li { margin-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 30px; position: relative; }
        li::before { content: "\f00c"; font-family: "Font Awesome 6 Free"; font-weight: 900; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--secondary); }
        .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 50px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #95a5a6; font-size: 0.9em; }
        .badge { background: var(--primary); color: white; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.8em; vertical-align: middle; margin-left: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <i class="fas fa-file-pdf"></i>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p><strong>PDF Viewer Pro</strong> <span class="badge">Official Version</span></p>
        <p style="color: #7f8c8d;">Last Updated: August 29, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="highlight-box">
        <strong><i class="fas fa-shield-halved"></i> Privacy Commitment:</strong> We believe that your documents are private and should stay that way. Our app is built on a 100% "Offline-First" architecture.
    </div>

    <h2><i class="fas fa-database"></i> 1. Information Collection</h2>
    <p>PDF Viewer Pro <strong>does not collect, store, or transmit</strong> any personal identification information. We respect your digital boundaries.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>No Account Required:</strong> You can use all professional features without ever creating an account or providing an email address.</li>
        <li><strong>Local Processing:</strong> All PDF modifications (Merging, Splitting, Signing, Watermarking) happen directly on your CPU. No data ever leaves your phone.</li>
        <li><strong>Zero Tracking:</strong> We do not use any analytics tools to track your location or usage habits.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2><i class="fas fa-key"></i> 2. Device Permissions</h2>
    <p>To function as a high-precision tool, the app requests the following access:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Media & Files:</strong> To open your documents and save the professional results to your <code>Documents/PDFViewer</code> folder.</li>
        <li><strong>Camera:</strong> Required only for the "Scan PDF" feature to convert physical papers into digital documents.</li>
        <li><strong>Internet:</strong> Used only to check for official App Updates from the Play Store and to display this Privacy Policy.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2><i class="fas fa-server"></i> 3. Third-Party Integration</h2>
    <p>We use industry-standard Google services for core functionality:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Google ML Kit:</strong> Provides local, high-speed document scanning technology.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Play Core:</strong> Ensures you are always running the latest, most secure version of the app via "Force Updates".</li>
    </ul>

    <h2><i class="fas fa-user-lock"></i> 4. Data Security</h2>
    <p>Your documents are protected by the Android operating system's security layers. Since we do not use cloud storage, you have 100% control over your files. We recommend using a system-level screen lock (Fingerprint/PIN) to further protect your device.</p>

    <h2><i class="fas fa-scale-balanced"></i> 5. Ethical Development</h2>
    <p>This application is developed with a focus on community service and professional utility. We promise a <strong>Clean Experience</strong>: No annoying ads, no subscription traps, and no hidden data mining.</p>

    <h2><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> 6. Contact Information</h2>
    <p>For support, feedback, or legal inquiries, please visit our official developer portal:</p>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">
        <a href="https://absalamofficial-cmyk.github.io/" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none;">
            <i class="fas fa-globe"></i> absalamofficial-cmyk.github.io
        </a>
    </p>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2026 Abdus Salam (CMYK) | Engineered in Pakistan</p>
        <p>Built with ❤️ for the Global PDF Community</p>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
